                                                "sense_id": "cd3fdf31-f423-326b-88e4-e139bf83e002",
                                                "text": "If the fixation is wavering, especially when receiving the horizontal afterimage with the centroscope a thin pointer is used by the child to touch the fixation spot."
                                            },
